    "termsOfUse": "As the dataset contains sensitive data (about pelvic floor complaints including sexual complaints, and sexuality, religion), a steering committee will assess the quality and relevance of the request for access of the data. When the steering committee agrees upon access, an agreement will be signed between the requesting party and the UMCG, including e.g. agreements about methodology, costs, publications, authorship, period of access to the data.",
